| 32346 | 18:28:06.592 | last row of the stopped run |
| 32347 | 18:33:12.512 | user `channel-user:` (queued follow-up; the user sent it at 09:43:05) |
| 32348 | 18:33:15.315 | user `command-input:["telegram",...,"4052"]` (`/stop`) |
