| 32355 | 18:33:19.605 | assistant `stopReason=error` |
| 32356 | 18:33:20.026 | `run-failed-before-reply` |

Second time: follow-up user row 32450 at 22:56:54.623 (message sent at 19:59:53), `/stop` rows 32451/32452 at 22:56:57.379/.381, refusal at 22:56:58.404, keyed-user error at 22:57:00.185.

### OpenClaw version

2026.10.10 (`e665daaf0e3`; the carry does not touch these files). Reproduced at unit level on v2026.11.1 and main `54ed2bcc74b`.

### Operating system

macOS 26.6.2 (Apple silicon), Node 26.12.1

### Install method

Built from source (fork of the release), Gateway as a launchd user agent

### Model

`qwen38-27b-rtx5090-prod` (primary), `qwen3.8-27b-uncensored-r9700` (fallback)

